      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TATTOOED BEAST (1) had been in great form but missed the frame latest when seventh (30.47) in a OPEN at this track. Normally fast to begin but shuffled back last time. Form here at the trip sound including four wins. Can discover winning form. KING NANGAR (2) turned in a moderate effort last time when eighth at this track over 520m behind Iconic Guess (30.52) in a OPEN. One of the better hopes. HUDSON (7) broke well and quickly mustered speed to win over the 509m at Northam two runs back then settled forward again when finishing second at Northam last start. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Hard to beat again. SWEET BEE (6) was strongly fancied on the back of a win two starts ago but finished fourth last time (30.46) at this track. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit.",
